                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (Finance Minister · jobs coalition · development partner)`,
                    coach_intro:            `Aurelia's entrepreneurship is two economies, not one: a vast necessity base that needs formalisation and a thin high-growth layer that needs finance and exit. The same peso buys very different outcomes in each. The Directive set two targets at once — more new firms AND more high-growth ventures — inside AUP 1.8 billion with no new debt. Decide whom you mean to grow, match the levers and the reform to that segment, and bring me a plan that is costed to the last peso. A plan that breaches the budget is just a wish list.`,

