                    r4_conviction_label:    `Conviction: how firmly do you hold the segment-aware, costed plan against the competing demands? (%)`,
                    def_dualkpi:            `Show how the plan moves BOTH headline KPIs within the budget — formation from the necessity side, high-growth share from the scalable side, reform aligned to the target`,
                    def_jobs:               `Lead on jobs and inclusion now — the visible new-firm count and the necessity story; play down the high-growth mandate`,
